<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Paragon Trade cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Paragon Trade cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Jensen Securities said it downgraded Paragon Trade Brands Inc to outperform from buy.</p>
<p>-- reduced earnings estimate to $2.05 per share from $2.60 for 1997, and to $3 from $3.25 for 1998.</p>
<p>-- cited expected increased competition and higher costs.</p>
<p>-- shares closed at 21-1/2 on Monday.</p>
</text>
